@984[2]. Man has been so created that he is spiritual and celestial love, and thus an image of God and a likeness of God. Spiritual love, which is the love of truth, is an image of God; and celestial love, which is the love of good, is a likeness of God. All the Angels in the Third Heaven are likenesses of God; and all the Angels in the Second Heaven are images of God.

